      "text": [
        "From first call to a live website, without the faff",
        "Most agencies hand you a website and disappear. We build it, launch it, and then keep it running — that's the whole point of the monthly plan.",
        "We talk",
        "A short call to understand your business, your customers, and what the site needs to do — book jobs, sell products, or just get the phone ringing.",
        "We design & build",
        "You get a proper design to react to, not a template dumped on you. We build it, you send feedback, we adjust it — usually two to three rounds.",
        "We launch",
        "Domain, hosting, email and analytics all set up properly. We handle the technical side so you don't have to touch a control panel.",
        "We look after it",
        "Every month: hosting, backups, security updates, and small content changes included. Big changes? Just ask — it's why we're still there.",
        "How it works"
