      "text": [
        "Small businesses, real results",
        "\"I'd been putting off getting a website for years because it felt like a huge job. Doman Digital had us live in under three weeks and I haven't had to think about it since.\"",
        "\"We needed our menu updated every week and our old web company charged us every time. With the monthly plan it's just included — I email them the changes and it's done.\"",
        "\"Online bookings went up noticeably in the first month. More importantly, when something needs changing I can actually get someone on the phone the same day.\"",
